{title: Thuma Mina}
{artist: South African traditional}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
[C]Thuma mina, thuma [F]mina,
thuma [C]mina, thuma mina, So[G7]mand[C]la.

Verse 2
[C]Send me, Jesus, send me, [F]Jesus,
send me, [C]Jesus, send me, [G7]Je[C]sus.

Verse 3
[C]Lead me, Jesus, lead me, [F]Jesus,
lead me, [C]Jesus, lead me, [G7]Je[C]sus.
